
# Playwright smoke artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Transient checklist-test driver scripts. A browser-lane runner must write its
# Playwright driver INSIDE this app so `require('@playwright/test')` resolves
# through pnpm's nesting (a script in /tmp cannot). Runners delete these when
# they finish, but a run in flight legitimately has them on disk — ignoring the
# pattern keeps `git status` honest for the other agents sharing this checkout.
#
# Match the whole `.qa-*` namespace, not just two script extensions: a runner
# that needs a spec + a playwright config writes a DIRECTORY (`.qa-st1/`), and a
# file-only pattern leaves it showing up as untracked in everyone else's tree.
.qa-*
